A big thank you to the team for hack and for posting the latest version.
Ftp access is rare in the UK !! A small warning for anybody compiling
with gcc on System V/386 (e.g.  AT&T, SCO, ISC) and possibly any other
gcc. You must add -traditional to the CFLAGS. Otherwise, nethack compiles
and runs fine but blows up on restoring a saved game. I haven't looked
into why, but if this happens to anybody, that is the probable cause.

